+// sits ABOVE FFNx in the input chain -- physical key events come from the
+// OS, hit our hook first, and never reach FFNx or the engine if we swallow
+// them. Auto-pilot's SendInput-injected arrows are flagged LLKHF_INJECTED
+// in KBDLLHOOKSTRUCT.flags and pass through cleanly. Aaron's physical
+// presses do not.
+//
+// Scope (matching Aaron's 2026-05-12 design clarification):
+//   Swallow during chase Auto: arrows + W/A/D/X.
+//   Preserve: S (pause), F-keys (audio/TTS control), and all other keys.
+//
